## Why This Is Asked

This assesses practical CSS performance and layout stability for dense, dynamic dashboards, focusing on containment, grid behavior, and motion design under continuous data updates.

## Key Concepts

- CSS containment (`contain: layout paint`)
- Grid auto-placement and fixed row heights
- Motion design: transforms vs height changes
- Accessibility: `prefers-reduced-motion`, focus management

## Code Example

